  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Turn a transcript accession or HGVS variant description into a to-scale exon diagram that shows reading frames, coding and non-coding parts, and coloured variant markers, and download it as an SVG. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
